{
  "$comment": [
    "WowType 设置契约：wowtype.conf 里每一项的键名、类型、默认值、范围或可选值，哪几端有。",
    "改设置项（加键、改名、改默认值、改范围或可选值）要先改这里，三端的测试都拿它对照，对不上 CI 就挂：",
    "  fcitx5   fcitx5-addon/src/wowtype_engine.h 的 WowtypeConfig（scripts/addon-test.sh 编 wowtype-config-dump 导出来比）",
    "  settings settings/wowtype-config（Linux 设置界面）的 DEFAULTS、RANGES 和各选项列表（scripts/test-config-contract.py）",
    "  macos    macos/Sources/Shared/Config.swift 的 WowtypeConfig（macos/test.sh）",
    "文件格式：一行一个 键=值，开关写 True / False，数字写十进制，值可以带双引号。",
    "default 是写进文件的值；platformDefault 是某一端故意不一样的默认值，why 写原因。",
    "platforms 列出有这一项的端；没列的端不认这个键（读到了不管，写回时原样留着）。"
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "ends": {
    "fcitx5": "Linux 的 fcitx5 插件（C++）",
    "settings": "Linux 的设置界面 wowtype-config（Python）",
    "macos": "macOS 输入法外壳（Swift），设置窗口和输入法共用 Shared/Config.swift"
  },
  "readRules": {
    "outOfRange": {
      "$comment": "数字超出 min–max 时读出来是什么。三端一样：夹到边上（PageSize=2 读成 3，=12 读成 9）。",
      "fcitx5": "clamp",
      "settings": "clamp",
      "macos": "clamp"
    },
    "notes": [
      "开关只认 True / False（区分大小写），别的写法（true、1、yes）读出来是默认值。",
      "枚举区分大小写，认不出（写错、大小写不对、不认识的双拼方案）读出来是默认值。",
      "数字认不出（abc、空的）读出来是默认值。",
      "键和值两边的空格、Tab 不算（PageSize = 5 读成 5）；fcitx5 自己会留着值前面的空格，插件读完再去掉。",
      "[分组] 下面的行（fcitx5 的 [Hotkey] 等）不是设置项，三端都不认，设置界面写回时原样留着。",
      "两边有双引号的值去掉引号，再把 \\\\、\\\"、\\n 还原（和 fcitx5 写文件时的转义对应）。"
    ],
    "cases": {
      "$comment": "三端都跑：file 是整个 wowtype.conf 的原文，expect 是读出来的值（写进文件的样子）。只用三端都有的键。",
      "items": [
        {"file": "TypoCorrection=false\nTraditional=1\nFuzzy=yes", "expect": {"TypoCorrection": "True", "Traditional": "False", "Fuzzy": "False"}},
        {"file": "TypoCorrection=False\nTraditional=True", "expect": {"TypoCorrection": "False", "Traditional": "True"}},
        {"file": "ShuangpinScheme=xiaohe\nCandidateLayout=vertical\nShiftToggle=left", "expect": {"ShuangpinScheme": "Ziranma", "CandidateLayout": "Horizontal", "ShiftToggle": "Both"}},
        {"file": "ShuangpinScheme=Xiaohe\nCandidateLayout=Vertical\nShiftToggle=Left", "expect": {"ShuangpinScheme": "Xiaohe", "CandidateLayout": "Vertical", "ShiftToggle": "Left"}},
        {"file": "ShuangpinScheme=Dvorak\nTranslateTarget=EN\nSelectKeys=semicolon", "expect": {"ShuangpinScheme": "Ziranma", "TranslateTarget": "en", "SelectKeys": "Off"}},
        {"file": "PageSize=abc\nTranslateIdleMinutes=", "expect": {"PageSize": "9", "TranslateIdleMinutes": "5"}},
        {"file": "PageSize=12\nTranslateIdleMinutes=-3", "expect": {"PageSize": "9", "TranslateIdleMinutes": "0"}},
        {"file": "PageSize=5\n\n[Hotkey]\nPageSize=4\nTraditional=True", "expect": {"PageSize": "5", "Traditional": "False"}},
        {"file": "[Hotkey]\nTranslateLocal=False\nTranslateBaseUrl=https://a/v1", "expect": {"TranslateLocal": "True", "TranslateBaseUrl": ""}},
        {"file": "Lexicon=\"/Users/me/词库 \\\"新\\\"\\\\v2.tsv\"", "expect": {"Lexicon": "/Users/me/词库 \"新\"\\v2.tsv"}},
        {"file": "Lexicon=  /a/b.tsv  ", "expect": {"Lexicon": "/a/b.tsv"}},
        {"file": "  TypoCorrection = False\nPageSize\t=\t5", "expect": {"TypoCorrection": "False", "PageSize": "5"}}
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": [
    {"key": "CandidateLayout", "type": "enum", "default": "Horizontal", "values": ["Horizontal", "Vertical"],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "候选排列：横排、竖排"},
    {"key": "PageSize", "type": "int", "default": 9, "min": 3, "max": 9,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "每页候选个数"},
    {"key": "CandidateFontSize", "type": "int", "default": 17, "min": 10, "max": 40,
     "platforms": ["macos"], "note": "候选字号（磅）。只有 macOS 有：Linux 上字号跟着 fcitx5 主题"},
    {"key": "PageKeysMinusEqual", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "翻页键 - ="},
    {"key": "PageKeysBracket", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "翻页键 [ ]"},
    {"key": "PageKeysCommaPeriod", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "翻页键 , ."},
    {"key": "PageKeysTab", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "翻页键 Shift+Tab Tab"},
    {"key": "Fuzzy", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "模糊音总开关，打开后下面各组分别生效"},
    {"key": "FuzzyZh", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "z = zh"},
    {"key": "FuzzyCh", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "c = ch"},
    {"key": "FuzzySh", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "s = sh"},
    {"key": "FuzzyNL", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "n = l"},
    {"key": "FuzzyFH", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "f = h"},
    {"key": "FuzzyRL", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "r = l"},
    {"key": "FuzzyAn", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "an = ang"},
    {"key": "FuzzyEn", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "en = eng"},
    {"key": "FuzzyIn", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "in = ing"},
    {"key": "FuzzyIan", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "ian = iang"},
    {"key": "FuzzyUan", "type": "bool", "default": true, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "uan = uang"},
    {"key": "FuzzyUn", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "un = ong"},
    {"key": "FuzzyAnAi", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "an = ai"},
    {"key": "FuzzyHuangWang", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "huang = wang"},
    {"key": "FuzzyUnIong", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "un = iong"},
    {"key": "FuzzyEngOng", "type": "bool", "default": false, "group": "fuzzy",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "eng = ong"},
    {"key": "TypoCorrection", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "按错键自动纠正"},
    {"key": "RareExtChars", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "候选末尾列出扩展 B 区以后的生僻字（常见字体显示不了，默认关）"},
    {"key": "Shuangpin", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "双拼输入"},
    {"key": "ShuangpinScheme", "type": "enum", "default": "Ziranma",
     "values": [
       {"value": "Ziranma", "name": "自然码"},
       {"value": "Xiaohe", "name": "小鹤双拼"},
       {"value": "Microsoft", "name": "微软双拼"},
       {"value": "Sogou", "name": "搜狗双拼"},
       {"value": "ABC", "name": "智能 ABC"},
       {"value": "Ziguang", "name": "紫光双拼"},
       {"value": "PinyinJiajia", "name": "拼音加加"}
     ],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"],
     "note": "双拼方案。name 是方案的名字，fcitx5（EnumI18n）和设置界面（SHUANGPIN_SCHEMES）都对照；macOS 的名字列表在 App/SettingsView.swift，测试编不到，只对照存盘名"},
    {"key": "ShuangpinShowKeys", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "双拼时编辑区显示打的键（uivs），不翻成全拼（shi'zhong）；中英混打时看得出打了什么（#122）"},
    {"key": "ShiftToggle", "type": "enum", "default": "Both", "values": ["Both", "Left", "Right", "Off"],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "单按哪个 Shift 切中英文"},
    {"key": "InitialMode", "type": "enum", "default": "Chinese", "values": ["Chinese", "English", "Last"],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings"],
     "note": "从别的输入法切到 WowType、开机后第一次用时是中文、英文，还是和上次切走时一样（Last）；换窗口不算。关了 Shift 切换时总是中文。macOS 还没有：每个应用一份模式，分不清切输入法和换应用"},
    {"key": "Traditional", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "输出繁体字"},
    {"key": "PunctuationStyle", "type": "enum", "default": "Fullwidth", "values": ["Fullwidth", "Halfwidth"],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "标点：中文标点、英文标点"},
    {"key": "SelectKeys", "type": "enum", "default": "Off", "values": ["Off", "Semicolon", "SemicolonQuote"],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "分号选第 2 个、引号选第 3 个"},
    {"key": "PickChar", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "以词定字：[ ] 上屏候选的第一个、最后一个字"},
    {"key": "DateTime", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "打 riqi、shijian、xingqi 时给出当前日期时间"},
    {"key": "Calculator", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "v 开头算算式（只在全拼下）"},
    {"key": "Toolbar", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "v + 空格打开工具栏（只在全拼下）"},
    {"key": "ClipboardHistory", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "记录剪贴板历史（只在内存里）。默认关：分不出密码管理器复制的密码"},
    {"key": "AutoSpace", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "汉字和英文、数字之间自动加空格（总开关）"},
    {"key": "AutoSpaceLetters", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "汉字和英文字母之间"},
    {"key": "AutoSpaceDigits", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "汉字和数字之间"},
    {"key": "Voice", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "语音输入"},
    {"key": "VoiceKey", "type": "key", "default": "Alt_R",
     "presets": {"settings": ["Alt_R", "Control_R", "Menu", "F8", "F9", "F10"],
                 "macos": ["Alt_R", "Control_R", "F8", "F9", "F10"]},
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"],
     "note": "语音键（fcitx5 键名）。presets 是设置界面里能选的键；macOS 上 Alt_R 是右 Option，Mac 键盘没有菜单键"},
    {"key": "VoiceCopy", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "语音识别的结果同时复制到剪贴板"},
    {"key": "EmojiSuggest", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "打字时推荐 emoji"},
    {"key": "EmojiKey", "type": "key", "default": "Super+period",
     "platformDefault": {"macos": "Control+period"},
     "why": "macOS 上 Command 组合键多半被应用的菜单先拿走、到不了输入法，所以 macOS 把 Super 当 Control：Linux 的 Super+period 拷过去就是 Control+period，和 macOS 的默认值一样",
     "presets": {"settings": ["Super+period", "Control+semicolon", "Control+Shift+E", ""]},
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"],
     "note": "打开表情面板的快捷键（fcitx5 键名），留空不用快捷键。macOS 设置窗口的选项列表在 App/SettingsView.swift，测试编不到，没对照"},
    {"key": "CheckUpdate", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings"], "note": "自动检查更新（最多一小时一次）。macOS 还没做"},
    {"key": "Translate", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "互译（Shift 切到「译」）"},
    {"key": "TranslateTarget", "type": "enum", "default": "en",
     "values": [
       {"value": "en", "name": "英语", "english": "English"},
       {"value": "ja", "name": "日语", "english": "Japanese"},
       {"value": "ko", "name": "韩语", "english": "Korean"},
       {"value": "fr", "name": "法语", "english": "French"},
       {"value": "de", "name": "德语", "english": "German"},
       {"value": "es", "name": "西班牙语", "english": "Spanish"},
       {"value": "ru", "name": "俄语", "english": "Russian"},
       {"value": "pt", "name": "葡萄牙语", "english": "Portuguese"},
       {"value": "it", "name": "意大利语", "english": "Italian"},
       {"value": "vi", "name": "越南语", "english": "Vietnamese"},
       {"value": "th", "name": "泰语", "english": "Thai"},
       {"value": "id", "name": "印尼语", "english": "Indonesian"},
       {"value": "ar", "name": "阿拉伯语", "english": "Arabic"}
     ],
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"],
     "note": "互译语言，代码和核心的 translate::LANGUAGES 一样。name 三端都对照（fcitx5 的 EnumI18n、设置界面的 TRANSLATE_LANGUAGES、macOS 的 WowtypeConfig.translateLanguages）；english 只有设置界面有"},
    {"key": "TranslateBaseUrl", "type": "string", "default": "",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "翻译服务地址（OpenAI 格式）。常见服务见 translateProviders"},
    {"key": "TranslateModel", "type": "string", "default": "",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "翻译用的模型"},
    {"key": "TranslateFormal", "type": "bool", "default": false,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "译文用正式语气（默认聊天口吻）"},
    {"key": "TranslateLocal", "type": "bool", "default": true,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"],
     "note": "用本地模型（HY-MT）翻译，默认是本地模型",
     "whenMissing": {
       "$comment": "文件里没有 TranslateLocal 这一行时：TranslateBaseUrl 填了（去掉两边空白不是空的）就是 value，否则用 default。三端读文件时都照这条规矩。",
       "ifNonEmpty": "TranslateBaseUrl",
       "value": false,
       "why": "0.3.10 及以前没有这一项，已经填好翻译接口的用户接着用接口，不会一升级就换成没下载的本地模型",
       "cases": [
         {"file": {}, "expect": true},
         {"file": {"TranslateBaseUrl": "https://api.example.com/v1"}, "expect": false},
         {"file": {"Translate": "True", "TranslateBaseUrl": "https://api.example.com/v1", "TranslateModel": "m"}, "expect": false},
         {"file": {"TranslateBaseUrl": ""}, "expect": true},
         {"file": {"TranslateBaseUrl": "   "}, "expect": true},
         {"file": {"TranslateBaseUrl": "https://api.example.com/v1", "TranslateLocal": "True"}, "expect": true},
         {"file": {"TranslateBaseUrl": "https://api.example.com/v1", "TranslateLocal": "False"}, "expect": false},
         {"file": {"TranslateLocal": "False"}, "expect": false}
       ]
     }},
    {"key": "TranslateLocalModel", "type": "string", "default": "",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "本地模型文件，留空用数据目录下 models/HY-MT1.5-1.8B-Q4_K_M.gguf"},
    {"key": "TranslateLlamaServer", "type": "string", "default": "",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "llama-server 的路径，留空自己找"},
    {"key": "TranslateIdleMinutes", "type": "int", "default": 5, "min": 0, "max": 240,
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"], "note": "本地模型闲置几分钟后释放内存，0 不释放"},
    {"key": "Lexicon", "type": "string", "default": "",
     "platforms": ["fcitx5", "settings", "macos"],
     "note": "词库文件，留空用自带的雾凇词库；文件不在也用自带的。切到万象时写成数据目录下的 dicts/wanxiang/lexicon.tsv（见 spec/lexicon-pack.json）"}
  ],
  "fcitx5External": {
    "keys": ["Settings"],
    "note": "fcitx5 配置工具里打开 wowtype-config 的按钮（ExternalOption），不存盘，不算设置项"
  },
  "translateProviders": {
    "$comment": "设置里「服务商」的预设：名字、接口地址、模型框空着时建议的模型。最后一项是「自己填地址」。设置界面（TRANSLATE_PROVIDERS）和 macOS（WowtypeConfig.translateProviders）都对照。",
    "platforms": ["settings", "macos"],
    "items": [
      {"name": "OpenAI", "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1", "model": ""},
      {"name": "DeepSeek", "url": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1", "model": "deepseek-chat"},
      {"name": "通义千问（阿里云百炼）", "url": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1", "model": "qwen-plus"},
      {"name": "Kimi（月之暗面）", "url": "https://api.moonshot.cn/v1", "model": "moonshot-v1-8k"},
      {"name": "智谱 GLM", "url": "https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4", "model": "glm-4-flash"},
      {"name": "硅基流动", "url": "https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1", "model": ""},
      {"name": "OpenRouter", "url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1", "model": ""},
      {"name": "Ollama（本机）", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1", "model": ""},
      {"name": "其他（自己填地址）", "url": "", "model": ""}
    ]
  }
}
